#: ../../source/api-reference/core.rst:5
msgid "QPE Engine"
msgstr "QPE 引擎"

#: of q2m3.core.qpe:1
msgid "Quantum Phase Estimation (QPE) implementation for molecular systems."
msgstr "用于分子系统的量子相位估计（QPE）实现。"

#: of q2m3.core.qpe:3
msgid ""
"Phase 2: Standard QPE circuit with: - HF state preparation via qml.BasisState - Controlled time "
"evolution via qml.TrotterProduct - Inverse QFT via qml.adjoint(qml.QFT)"
msgstr ""
"阶段 2：标准 QPE 电路，包括：- 通过 qml.BasisState 制备 HF 态；- 通过 qml.TrotterProduct 实现受控时间演化；- 通过 "
"qml.adjoint(qml.QFT) 实现逆 QFT。"

#: of q2m3.core.qpe:8
msgid "Phase 4: Catalyst @qjit integration for JIT compilation support."
msgstr "阶段 4：集成 Catalyst @qjit，支持 JIT 编译。"

#: of q2m3.core.qpe.QPEEngine:1
msgid "Iterative Quantum Phase Estimation engine for QM/MM calculations."
msgstr "用于 QM/MM 计算的迭代量子相位估计引擎。"

#: of q2m3.core.qpe.QPEEngine:3
msgid ""
"Implements the iterative QPE algorithm optimized for near-term quantum devices, targeting early "
"fault-tolerant quantum computers (EFTQC)."
msgstr "实现面向近期量子设备优化的迭代 QPE 算法，目标为早期容错量子计算机（EFTQC）。"

