msgstr "PennyLane 设备名称（已弃用，改用 device_type）"

#: of q2m3.core.qpe.QPEEngine.__init__:7
msgid ""
"Device selection strategy: - \"auto\": Auto-select best available (GPU > lightning.qubit > "
"default.qubit) - \"default.qubit\": Standard PennyLane simulator - \"lightning.qubit\": High-"
"performance CPU simulator (default) - \"lightning.gpu\": GPU-accelerated simulator (requires "
"cuQuantum)"
msgstr ""
"设备选择策略：- \"auto\"：自动选择可用的最佳设备 (GPU > lightning.qubit > default.qubit)；- \"default.qubit\"：标准 "
"PennyLane 模拟器；- \"lightning.qubit\"：高性能 CPU 模拟器（默认）；- \"lightning.gpu\"：GPU 加速模拟器（需要 cuQuantum）。"

#: of q2m3.core.qpe.QPEEngine.__init__:12
