"This is a classical simulation that mimics QPE behavior for POC purposes. Uses PySCF Hartree-Fock"
" results as approximation. Both the result and its simulated convergence are labeled "
"hf_reference."
msgstr "此经典模拟为概念验证而模拟 QPE 行为。使用 PySCF Hartree-Fock 结果作近似。结果及其模拟收敛过程均标记为 hf_reference。"

#: of q2m3.core.qpe.QPEEngine.estimate_ground_state_energy:7
msgid "Dictionary containing molecular data from PySCF"
msgstr "包含 PySCF 分子数据的字典"

#: of q2m3.core.qpe.QPEEngine.estimate_ground_state_energy:8
msgid "Initial quantum state preparation (unused in classical sim)"
msgstr "初始量子态制备（经典模拟中不使用）"

