msgstr "返回类型"

#: of q2m3.core.qpe.QPEEngine.compute_optimal_base_time:1
msgid "Compute optimal base_time to avoid phase overflow in QPE."
msgstr "计算避免 QPE 相位溢出的最优 base_time。"

#: of q2m3.core.qpe.QPEEngine.compute_optimal_base_time:3
msgid ""
"For QPE, the relationship is: ``phi = |E| * t / (2*pi)``. To avoid overflow, we need ``phi < 1``,"
" i.e., ``t < 2*pi / |E|``."
msgstr "QPE 满足关系 ``phi = |E| * t / (2*pi)``。为避免溢出，需满足 ``phi < 1``，即 ``t < 2*pi / |E|``。"

#: of q2m3.core.qpe.QPEEngine.compute_optimal_base_time:6
msgid "Estimated ground state energy (e.g., HF energy)"
msgstr "估计的基态能量（例如 HF 能量）"

#: of q2m3.core.qpe.QPEEngine.compute_optimal_base_time:7
msgid "Safety factor (default: PHASE_SAFETY_MARGIN = 0.8)"
msgstr "安全系数（默认：PHASE_SAFETY_MARGIN = 0.8）"

#: of q2m3.core.qpe.QPEEngine.compute_optimal_base_time:9
msgid "Optimal base_time that avoids phase overflow"
msgstr "避免相位溢出的最优 base_time"

#: of q2m3.core.qpe.QPEEngine.compute_shifted_qpe_params:1
msgid "Compute optimal QPE parameters for energy-shifted QPE."
msgstr "计算能量平移 QPE 的最优参数。"

#: of q2m3.core.qpe.QPEEngine.compute_shifted_qpe_params:3
msgid ""
"In energy-shifted QPE, the Hamiltonian is transformed as H' = H - E_ref * I, where E_ref is "
"typically the HF energy. This allows QPE to measure ΔE = E - E_ref instead of the absolute energy"
" E, enabling higher precision for detecting small energy changes like MM embedding effects."
msgstr ""
"能量平移 QPE 将哈密顿量变换为 H' = H - E_ref * I，其中 E_ref 通常为 HF 能量。这使 QPE 测量 ΔE = E - E_ref，而非绝对能量 "
"E，从而更精确地检测微小能量变化，例如 MM 嵌入效应。"

#: of q2m3.core.qpe.QPEEngine.compute_shifted_qpe_params:8
msgid ""
"Physics: - QPE measures phase: ``φ = |ΔE| * t / (2π)`` - For n-bit precision: ``resolution = 2π /"
" (2^n * t)`` - Energy range: ``ΔE_max = 2π / t`` (to avoid phase overflow)"
msgstr ""
"物理关系：- QPE 测量相位：``φ = |ΔE| * t / (2π)``；- 对 n 位精度：``resolution = 2π / (2^n * t)``；- 能量范围：``ΔE_max"
" = 2π / t`` （用于避免相位溢出）。"

#: of q2m3.core.qpe.QPEEngine.compute_shifted_qpe_params:13
msgid ""
"This method calculates the optimal n_estimation_wires and base_time to achieve the target "
"resolution while covering the expected energy range."
msgstr "此方法计算最优 n_estimation_wires 和 base_time，在覆盖预期能量范围的同时达到目标分辨率。"

#: of q2m3.core.qpe.QPEEngine.compute_shifted_qpe_params:16
msgid "Target energy resolution in Hartree (default: 0.001 Ha ≈ 0.63 kcal/mol)"
msgstr "目标能量分辨率，单位为 Hartree（默认：0.001 Ha ≈ 0.63 kcal/mol）"

#: of q2m3.core.qpe.QPEEngine.compute_shifted_qpe_params:17
msgid "Expected energy range around E_ref in Hartree (default: ±0.1 Ha)"
msgstr "E_ref 附近的预期能量范围，单位为 Hartree（默认：±0.1 Ha）"

#: of q2m3.core.qpe.QPEEngine.compute_shifted_qpe_params:18
msgid "Safety factor for phase overflow (default: PHASE_SAFETY_MARGIN)"
msgstr "相位溢出的安全系数（默认：PHASE_SAFETY_MARGIN）"

#: of q2m3.core.qpe.QPEEngine.compute_shifted_qpe_params:20
msgid ""
"- n_estimation_wires: Number of estimation qubits for target precision - base_time: Optimal base "
"evolution time - resolution: Actual energy resolution achieved - max_energy_range: Maximum "
"measurable energy range - phase_cycles: Number of phase cycles for ΔE at edge of range"
msgstr ""
"- n_estimation_wires: 达到目标精度所需的估计量子比特数 - base_time: 最优基础演化时间 - resolution: 实际达到的能量分辨率 - "
"max_energy_range: 最大可测能量范围 - phase_cycles: 范围边界处 ΔE 对应的相位周期数"

#: of q2m3.core.qpe.QPEEngine.compute_shifted_qpe_params:20
msgid "n_estimation_wires: Number of estimation qubits for target precision"
msgstr "n_estimation_wires: 达到目标精度所需的估计量子比特数"

#: of q2m3.core.qpe.QPEEngine.compute_shifted_qpe_params:21
msgid "base_time: Optimal base evolution time"
msgstr "base_time: 最优基础演化时间"

#: of q2m3.core.qpe.QPEEngine.compute_shifted_qpe_params:22
msgid "resolution: Actual energy resolution achieved"
msgstr "resolution: 实际达到的能量分辨率"

#: of q2m3.core.qpe.QPEEngine.compute_shifted_qpe_params:23
msgid "max_energy_range: Maximum measurable energy range"
msgstr "max_energy_range: 最大可测能量范围"

#: of q2m3.core.qpe.QPEEngine.compute_shifted_qpe_params:24
msgid "phase_cycles: Number of phase cycles for ΔE at edge of range"
msgstr "phase_cycles: 范围边界处 ΔE 对应的相位周期数"

