#: ../../source/api-reference/core.rst:26
msgid "Reduced Density Matrix"
msgstr "约化密度矩阵"

#: of q2m3.core.rdm:1
msgid "Reduced Density Matrix (RDM) estimation from quantum states."
msgstr "从量子态估计约化密度矩阵（RDM）。"

#: of q2m3.core.rdm:3
msgid ""
"Implements 1-RDM measurement using Pauli expectation values after Jordan-Wigner transformation of"
" fermionic operators."
msgstr "对费米子算符进行 Jordan-Wigner 变换后，使用 Pauli 期望值测量 1-RDM。"

#: of q2m3.core.rdm:6
msgid "Key formulas::"
msgstr "关键公式::"

#: of q2m3.core.rdm:13
msgid ""
"Performance optimization (Phase 7): - Batched measurement: single QNode returns all observables "
"(120x → 1x execution) - GPU acceleration via device_utils - Catalyst @qjit support"
msgstr ""
"性能优化（阶段 7）：- 批量测量：单个 QNode 返回所有可观测量（执行次数从 120x 降至 1x）；- 通过 device_utils 实现 GPU 加速；- 支持 Catalyst "
"@qjit。"

#: of q2m3.core.rdm.RDMEstimator:1
msgid "1-RDM measurement from quantum states using Pauli expectation values."
msgstr "使用 Pauli 期望值从量子态测量 1-RDM。"

#: of q2m3.core.rdm.RDMEstimator:3
msgid ""
"Measures the one-particle reduced density matrix (1-RDM) from a quantum state prepared by Trotter"
" time evolution. Uses Jordan-Wigner transformation to convert fermionic operators to Pauli "
"observables."
msgstr "从 Trotter 时间演化制备的量子态测量单粒子约化密度矩阵（1-RDM）。使用 Jordan-Wigner 变换将费米子算符转换为 Pauli 可观测量。"

#: of q2m3.core.rdm.RDMEstimator:7
msgid ""
"Performance optimization: Uses batched measurement (single QNode) instead of individual QNodes "
"per observable for 10-50x speedup."
msgstr "性能优化：使用批量测量（单个 QNode），而非每个可观测量单独使用 QNode，可获得 10-50x 加速。"

#: of q2m3.core.rdm.RDMEstimator.__init__:1
msgid "Initialize RDM estimator."
msgstr "初始化 RDM 估计器。"

#: of q2m3.core.rdm.RDMEstimator.__init__:3
msgid "Number of spin orbitals (qubits in Jordan-Wigner)"
msgstr "自旋轨道数（Jordan-Wigner 映射中的量子比特数）"

#: of q2m3.core.rdm.RDMEstimator.__init__:4
msgid "Number of electrons in the system"
msgstr "系统中的电子数"

#: of q2m3.core.rdm.RDMEstimator.__init__:5
msgid ""
"Optional configuration dictionary with keys: - n_shots: Number of measurement shots (default: "
"1000) - include_off_diagonal: Measure off-diagonal elements (default: True) - symmetrize: Enforce"
" Hermitian symmetry (default: True) - output_basis: \"spin\" or \"spatial\" (default: \"spin\")"
msgstr ""
"可选配置字典，包含以下键：- n_shots: 测量次数（默认：1000）；- include_off_diagonal: 测量非对角元素（默认：True）；- symmetrize: "
"强制满足厄米对称性（默认：True）；- output_basis: \"spin\" 或 \"spatial\"（默认：\"spin\"）。"

#: of q2m3.core.rdm.RDMEstimator.measure_1rdm:1
msgid "Measure 1-RDM from Trotter-evolved state using batched measurement."
msgstr "通过批量测量，从 Trotter 演化态测量 1-RDM。"

#: of q2m3.core.rdm.RDMEstimator.measure_1rdm:3
msgid ""
"Prepares ``|HF>`` , applies TrotterProduct time evolution, then measures all 1-RDM elements as "
"Pauli expectation values in a single QNode."
msgstr "制备 ``|HF>``，施加 TrotterProduct 时间演化，再在单个 QNode 中将所有 1-RDM 元素测为 Pauli 期望值。"

#: of q2m3.core.rdm.RDMEstimator.measure_1rdm:7
msgid "Hartree-Fock reference state binary array"
msgstr "Hartree-Fock 参考态的二进制数组"

#: of q2m3.core.rdm.RDMEstimator.draw_rdm_circuit:8 q2m3.core.rdm.RDMEstimator.measure_1rdm:8
msgid "Evolution time for Trotter"
msgstr "Trotter 演化时间"

#: of q2m3.core.rdm.RDMEstimator.draw_rdm_circuit:9 q2m3.core.rdm.RDMEstimator.measure_1rdm:9
msgid "Number of Trotter steps"
msgstr "Trotter 步数"

#: of q2m3.core.rdm.RDMEstimator.measure_1rdm:10
msgid ""
"Device selection strategy: - \"auto\": Auto-select best (GPU > lightning.qubit > default.qubit) -"
" \"default.qubit\": Standard PennyLane simulator - \"lightning.qubit\": High-performance CPU "
"simulator - \"lightning.gpu\": GPU-accelerated simulator"
msgstr ""
"设备选择策略：- \"auto\"：自动选择最佳设备 (GPU > lightning.qubit > default.qubit)；- \"default.qubit\"：标准 "
"PennyLane 模拟器；- \"lightning.qubit\"：高性能 CPU 模拟器；- \"lightning.gpu\"：GPU 加速模拟器。"

#: of q2m3.core.rdm.RDMEstimator.measure_1rdm:15 q2m3.core.rdm.measure_rdm_from_qpe_state:10
msgid "Enable Catalyst @qjit compilation"
msgstr "启用 Catalyst @qjit 编译"

#: of q2m3.core.rdm.RDMEstimator.measure_1rdm:17
msgid "1-RDM as numpy array of shape (n_qubits, n_qubits)"
msgstr "numpy 数组形式的 1-RDM，形状为 (n_qubits, n_qubits)"

#: of q2m3.core.rdm.RDMEstimator.build_rdm_observables:1
msgid "Build Pauli observables for all 1-RDM elements (legacy interface)."
msgstr "构建所有 1-RDM 元素的 Pauli 可观测量（旧接口）。"

#: of q2m3.core.rdm.RDMEstimator.build_rdm_observables:3
msgid ""
"Dictionary mapping (p, q) indices to PennyLane observables. For p == q: number operator "
"observable For p < q: tuple of 4 Pauli observables for real/imag parts"
msgstr "将 (p, q) 索引映射到 PennyLane 可观测量的字典。p == q 时为粒子数算符可观测量；p < q 时为包含 4 个 Pauli 可观测量的元组，分别用于实部和虚部。"

#: of q2m3.core.rdm.RDMEstimator.enforce_physical_constraints:1
msgid "Enforce physical constraints on 1-RDM."
msgstr "强制 1-RDM 满足物理约束。"

#: of q2m3.core.rdm.RDMEstimator.enforce_physical_constraints:3
msgid ""
"Constraints: 1. Hermiticity: γ_pq = γ_qp* 2. Positive semi-definiteness: all eigenvalues >= 0 3. "
"Trace normalization: Tr(γ) = N_electrons"
msgstr "约束：1. 厄米性：γ_pq = γ_qp*；2. 半正定性：所有本征值 >= 0；3. 迹归一化：Tr(γ) = N_electrons。"

#: of q2m3.core.rdm.RDMEstimator.enforce_physical_constraints:8
msgid "Raw 1-RDM from measurement"
msgstr "测量得到的原始 1-RDM"

#: of q2m3.core.rdm.RDMEstimator.enforce_physical_constraints:10
msgid "Physically valid 1-RDM"
msgstr "满足物理约束的 1-RDM"

#: of q2m3.core.rdm.RDMEstimator.draw_rdm_circuit:1
msgid "Generate text visualization of RDM measurement circuit."
msgstr "生成 RDM 测量电路的文本可视化。"

#: of q2m3.core.rdm.RDMEstimator.draw_rdm_circuit:10
msgid "Max observables to show (default: 4)"
msgstr "显示的最大可观测量数（默认：4）"

#: of q2m3.core.rdm.RDMEstimator.spin_to_spatial_rdm:1
msgid "Convert spin-orbital 1-RDM to spatial-orbital 1-RDM."
msgstr "将自旋轨道 1-RDM 转换为空间轨道 1-RDM。"

#: of q2m3.core.rdm.RDMEstimator.spin_to_spatial_rdm:3
msgid "For restricted systems, spatial RDM = sum of alpha and beta spin blocks."
msgstr "对于限制性体系，空间 RDM = alpha 与 beta 自旋块之和。"

#: of q2m3.core.rdm.RDMEstimator.spin_to_spatial_rdm:5
msgid "1-RDM in spin-orbital basis, shape (2*n_spatial, 2*n_spatial)"
msgstr "自旋轨道基下的 1-RDM，形状为 (2*n_spatial, 2*n_spatial)"

#: of q2m3.core.rdm.RDMEstimator.spin_to_spatial_rdm:7
msgid "1-RDM in spatial-orbital basis, shape (n_spatial, n_spatial)"
msgstr "空间轨道基下的 1-RDM，形状为 (n_spatial, n_spatial)"

#: of q2m3.core.rdm.RDMEstimator.active_mo_to_ao_rdm:1
msgid "Convert the spatial-orbital 1-RDM from the active space to the AO basis."
msgstr "将活性空间的空间轨道 1-RDM 转换到 AO 基。"

#: of q2m3.core.rdm.RDMEstimator.active_mo_to_ao_rdm:3
msgid ""
"Steps: 1. Embed active space RDM into full MO RDM 2. Transform from MO to AO basis: P_AO = C @ "
"P_MO @ C^T"
msgstr "步骤：1. 将活性空间 RDM 嵌入完整 MO RDM；2. 从 MO 基变换到 AO 基：P_AO = C @ P_MO @ C^T。"

#: of q2m3.core.rdm.RDMEstimator.active_mo_to_ao_rdm:7
msgid "1-RDM in active MO basis, shape (active_orbitals, active_orbitals)"
msgstr "活性 MO 基下的 1-RDM，形状为 (active_orbitals, active_orbitals)"

#: of q2m3.core.rdm.RDMEstimator.active_mo_to_ao_rdm:8
msgid "MO coefficient matrix from HF, shape (n_ao, n_mo)"
msgstr "HF 的 MO 系数矩阵，形状为 (n_ao, n_mo)"

#: of q2m3.core.rdm.RDMEstimator.active_mo_to_ao_rdm:9
msgid "MO occupation numbers from HF, shape (n_mo,)"
msgstr "HF 的 MO 占据数，形状为 (n_mo,)"

