msgid "Active space orbitals (optional)."
msgstr "活性空间轨道数（可选）。"

#: of q2m3.core.resource_estimation.estimate_qpe_resources_from_integrals:10
#: q2m3.core.resource_estimation.estimate_resources:12
msgid "Target energy error in Hartree (default: 0.0016 = 1 kcal/mol)."
msgstr "目标能量误差，单位为 Hartree（默认：0.0016 = 1 kcal/mol）。"

#: of q2m3.core.resource_estimation.estimate_resources:13
msgid "MM point charges array (optional, enables solvated Hamiltonian)."
msgstr "MM 点电荷数组（可选，启用溶剂化哈密顿量）。"

#: of q2m3.core.resource_estimation.estimate_resources:14
msgid "MM charge coordinates in Angstrom, shape (n_mm, 3)."
msgstr "以埃为单位的 MM 电荷坐标，形状为 (n_mm, 3)。"

#: of q2m3.core.resource_estimation.estimate_resources:15
msgid ""
"MM embedding mode for resource rows. Defaults to the historical full fixed-MO one-electron "
"resource behavior."
msgstr "资源结果的 MM 嵌入模式。默认保留原有的完整固定 MO 单电子资源估计行为。"

#: of q2m3.core.resource_estimation.estimate_resources:18
msgid "EFTQCResources dataclass with all resource fields populated."
msgstr "所有资源字段均已填充的 EFTQCResources 数据类。"

#: of q2m3.core.resource_estimation.estimate_qpe_resources_from_integrals:1
msgid "Estimate EFTQC resources for the Hamiltonian of given active-space integrals."
msgstr "估计给定活性空间积分对应哈密顿量的 EFTQC 资源。"

#: of q2m3.core.resource_estimation.estimate_qpe_resources_from_integrals:3
msgid ""
"The estimate is the double-factorization cost of the Hamiltonian, with the same "
"DoubleFactorization settings as ``estimate_resources``. No circuit is run."
msgstr "估计值是该哈密顿量的双因子分解成本，DoubleFactorization 的设置与 ``estimate_resources`` 相同。不运行任何电路。"

#: of q2m3.core.resource_estimation.estimate_qpe_resources_from_integrals:6
msgid "Real symmetric one-electron integrals, shape ``(norb, norb)``."
msgstr "实对称单电子积分，形状为 ``(norb, norb)``。"

#: of q2m3.core.resource_estimation.estimate_qpe_resources_from_integrals:7
msgid "Real two-electron integrals in chemist notation ``(pq|rs)``, shape ``(norb, norb, norb, norb)``."
msgstr "化学家记号 ``(pq|rs)`` 的实数双电子积分，形状为 ``(norb, norb, norb, norb)``。"

#: of q2m3.core.resource_estimation.estimate_qpe_resources_from_integrals:9
msgid "Basis set label recorded in the result."
msgstr "写入结果的基组名称。"

#: of q2m3.core.resource_estimation.estimate_qpe_resources_from_integrals:12
msgid "EFTQCResources for the vacuum active-space Hamiltonian."
msgstr "真空活性空间哈密顿量的 EFTQCResources。"

#: ../../source/api-reference/core.rst
msgid "Raises"
msgstr "异常"

#: of q2m3.core.resource_estimation.estimate_qpe_resources_from_integrals:14
msgid "The shapes do not match or the integrals violate the real chemist     permutation symmetry."
msgstr "形状不匹配，或积分不满足实数化学家记号的置换对称性。"

#: of q2m3.core.resource_estimation.compare_vacuum_solvated:1
msgid "Compare EFTQC resource requirements between vacuum and solvated systems."
msgstr "比较真空与溶剂化系统的 EFTQC 资源需求。"

#: of q2m3.core.resource_estimation.compare_vacuum_solvated:3
msgid ""
"This function calls estimate_resources() twice: once without MM charges (vacuum) and once with MM"
" charges (solvated). It then computes the percentage deltas."
msgstr "此函数调用 estimate_resources() 两次：一次不使用 MM 电荷（真空），另一次使用 MM 电荷（溶剂化）。随后计算百分比变化。"

#: of q2m3.core.resource_estimation.compare_vacuum_solvated:7
msgid "List of atomic symbols."
msgstr "原子符号列表。"

#: of q2m3.core.resource_estimation.compare_vacuum_solvated:13
msgid "MM point charges for the solvated estimate."
msgstr "溶剂化估计所用的 MM 点电荷。"

#: of q2m3.core.resource_estimation.compare_vacuum_solvated:14
msgid "MM charge coordinates in Angstrom for the solvated estimate."
msgstr "溶剂化估计所用的 MM 电荷坐标，单位为埃。"

#: of q2m3.core.resource_estimation.compare_vacuum_solvated:15
msgid "Target energy error in Hartree (default: 0.0016)."
msgstr "目标能量误差，单位为 Hartree（默认：0.0016）。"

#: of q2m3.core.resource_estimation.compare_vacuum_solvated:16
msgid "MM embedding mode for the solvated resource row."
msgstr "溶剂化资源结果的 MM 嵌入模式。"

#: of q2m3.core.resource_estimation.compare_vacuum_solvated:18
msgid "ResourceComparisonResult with both estimates and derived deltas."
msgstr "包含两项估计及其变化量的 ResourceComparisonResult。"

#: of q2m3.core.resource_estimation.derive_t_resources:1
msgid "Derive T-count and conservative T-depth from Toffoli count."
msgstr "从 Toffoli 门数推导 T 门数和保守的 T 深度。"

#: of q2m3.core.resource_estimation.derive_t_resources:3
msgid ""
"DoubleFactorization returns Toffoli count and logical qubits but not the T-depth that surface-"
"code-style analyses require. Use the standard fault-tolerant relation T-count = 7 * Toffoli-count"
" and a conservative sequential upper bound for depth."
msgstr ""
"DoubleFactorization 返回 Toffoli 门数与逻辑量子比特数，但不返回表面码类分析所需的 T 深度。使用标准容错关系 T-count = 7 * Toffoli-"
"count，并使用深度的保守串行上界。"

#: of q2m3.core.resource_estimation.derive_t_resources:8
msgid "Total Toffoli gate count from DoubleFactorization."
msgstr "DoubleFactorization 给出的 Toffoli 门总数。"

#: of q2m3.core.resource_estimation.derive_t_resources:10
msgid ""
"- t_count: 7 * toffoli_gates - toffoli_depth: conservative sequential upper bound (= "
"toffoli_gates) - t_depth: T_PER_TOFFOLI * toffoli_depth (sequential upper bound)"
msgstr ""
"- t_count: 7 * toffoli_gates - toffoli_depth: 保守串行上界 (= toffoli_gates) - t_depth: T_PER_TOFFOLI *"
" toffoli_depth（串行上界）"

#: of q2m3.core.resource_estimation.derive_t_resources:10
msgid "t_count: 7 * toffoli_gates"
msgstr "t_count: 7 * toffoli_gates"

#: of q2m3.core.resource_estimation.derive_t_resources:11
msgid "toffoli_depth: conservative sequential upper bound (= toffoli_gates)"
msgstr "toffoli_depth: 保守串行上界 (= toffoli_gates)"

#: of q2m3.core.resource_estimation.derive_t_resources:12
msgid "t_depth: T_PER_TOFFOLI * toffoli_depth (sequential upper bound)"
msgstr "t_depth: T_PER_TOFFOLI * toffoli_depth（串行上界）"

#: of q2m3.core.resource_estimation.surface_code_distance:1
msgid "Smallest odd surface-code distance keeping the whole run below ``failure_budget``."
msgstr "使整次运行的失败概率低于 ``failure_budget`` 的最小奇数表面码距离。"

#: of q2m3.core.resource_estimation.surface_code_distance:3
msgid ""
"This function uses the Litinski (Quantum 3, 128 (2019), Eq. 10) logical error model: ``p_L(d) = "
"0.1 * (100 * p_phys) ** ((d + 1) / 2)`` per logical qubit per code cycle. It assumes that each "
"Toffoli occupies one logical time step of ``d`` code cycles for every logical qubit."
msgstr ""
"此函数使用 Litinski (Quantum 3, 128 (2019), Eq. 10) 的逻辑错误模型：每个逻辑量子比特在每个码周期的错误率为 ``p_L(d) = 0.1 * (100 "
"* p_phys) ** ((d + 1) / 2)``。假设每个 Toffoli 对每个逻辑量子比特均占用一个逻辑时间步，每步为 ``d`` 个码周期。"

#: of q2m3.core.resource_estimation.surface_code_distance:8
msgid "Number of logical (data) qubits."
msgstr "逻辑（数据）量子比特数。"

#: of q2m3.core.resource_estimation.surface_code_distance:9
msgid "Total sequential Toffoli count of the algorithm."
msgstr "算法的串行 Toffoli 总数。"

#: of q2m3.core.resource_estimation.surface_code_distance:10
msgid "Physical error rate per gate / code cycle."
msgstr "每个门／码周期的物理错误率。"

#: of q2m3.core.resource_estimation.estimate_eftqc_runtime:21
#: q2m3.core.resource_estimation.surface_code_distance:11
msgid "Accepted total logical failure probability."
msgstr "可接受的总逻辑失败概率。"

#: of q2m3.core.resource_estimation.surface_code_distance:13
msgid "Code distance ``d`` (odd integer in [3, 99])."
msgstr "码距 ``d`` （[3, 99] 内的奇数）。"

#: of q2m3.core.resource_estimation.surface_code_distance:15
msgid "If no distance below 101 meets the budget."
msgstr "不存在小于 101 且满足预算的码距时。"

#: of q2m3.core.resource_estimation.estimate_eftqc_runtime:1
msgid "Estimate wall-clock runtime and physical footprint of an EFTQC QPE run."
msgstr "估计 EFTQC QPE 运行的实际时间与物理资源占用。"

#: of q2m3.core.resource_estimation.estimate_eftqc_runtime:3
msgid ""
"Surface-code model: ``runtime = toffoli_gates * tick`` with ``tick = max(t_react, 5.5 * d * "
"t_cycle / n_factories)`` — one CCZ per ``5.5 d`` code cycles per factory (Gidney & Fowler, "
"Quantum 3, 135 (2019); Babbush et al., PRX Quantum 2, 010103 (2021), Eq. 6), floored by the "
"classical reaction time (Lee et al., PRX Quantum 2, 030305 (2021))."
msgstr ""
"表面码模型：``runtime = toffoli_gates * tick``，其中 ``tick = max(t_react, 5.5 * d * t_cycle / "
"n_factories)``。每个工厂每 ``5.5 d`` 个码周期产出一个 CCZ（Gidney & Fowler, Quantum 3, 135 (2019); Babbush et "
"al., PRX Quantum 2, 010103 (2021), Eq. 6），且 tick 不低于经典反应时间（Lee et al., PRX Quantum 2, 030305 "
"(2021)）。"

#: of q2m3.core.resource_estimation.estimate_eftqc_runtime:9
msgid ""
"``toffoli_gates`` is the **total** count for the whole algorithm. PennyLane "
"``DoubleFactorization.gates`` / ``EFTQCResources.toffoli_gates`` report exactly this count. It "
"already contains the ``ceil(pi*lambda/(2*eps))`` phase-estimation repetitions. This function "
"therefore applies no iteration-count multiplier."
msgstr ""
"``toffoli_gates`` 是整个算法的**总**门数。PennyLane ``DoubleFactorization.gates`` / "
"``EFTQCResources.toffoli_gates`` 返回的正是此值。它已包含 ``ceil(pi*lambda/(2*eps))`` 次相位估计重复。因此，此函数不再乘以迭代次数。"

#: of q2m3.core.resource_estimation.estimate_eftqc_runtime:14
msgid "Total Toffoli count of the algorithm."
msgstr "算法的 Toffoli 总数。"

#: of q2m3.core.resource_estimation.estimate_eftqc_runtime:15
msgid "Number of logical qubits (sets the code distance)."
msgstr "逻辑量子比特数（决定码距）。"

#: of q2m3.core.resource_estimation.estimate_eftqc_runtime:16
msgid "Physical error rate (default 1e-3, superconducting assumption)."
msgstr "物理错误率（默认 1e-3，采用超导假设）。"

#: of q2m3.core.resource_estimation.estimate_eftqc_runtime:17
msgid "Surface-code cycle time (default 1 us)."
msgstr "表面码周期时间（默认 1 us）。"

#: of q2m3.core.resource_estimation.estimate_eftqc_runtime:18
msgid "Classical reaction time floor (default 10 us)."
msgstr "经典反应时间下限（默认 10 us）。"

#: of q2m3.core.resource_estimation.estimate_eftqc_runtime:19
msgid ""
"Number of parallel CCZ factories. The default is 1 (sequential upper bound). Lee 2021 FeMoco uses"
" 4."
msgstr "并行 CCZ 工厂数。默认为 1（串行上界）。Lee 2021 FeMoco 使用 4 个。"

#: of q2m3.core.resource_estimation.estimate_eftqc_runtime:23
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Dict with ``code_distance``, ``tick_microseconds``, ``regime`` (\"factory\" or \"reaction\"), "
"``runtime_{microseconds,seconds,hours,days}``, ``physical_qubits`` (2(d+1)^2 per logical qubit + "
"15d x 8d per factory), and the input assumptions echoed back."
msgstr ""
"字典，包含 ``code_distance``、``tick_microseconds``、``regime`` （\"factory\" 或 "
"\"reaction\"）、``runtime_{microseconds,seconds,hours,days}``、``physical_qubits`` （每个逻辑量子比特 "
"2(d+1)^2，加上每个工厂 15d x 8d），并回传输入假设。"

#: ../../source/api-reference/core.rst:40
msgid "Device Utilities"
msgstr "设备工具"

#: of q2m3.core.device_utils:1
msgid "Quantum device selection and management utilities."
msgstr "量子设备选择与管理工具。"

#: of q2m3.core.device_utils:3
msgid ""
"Provides unified device selection logic for QPE and RDM modules, with GPU acceleration support "
"and Catalyst compatibility."
msgstr "为 QPE 与 RDM 模块提供统一的设备选择逻辑，支持 GPU 加速并兼容 Catalyst。"

#: of q2m3.core.device_utils:6
msgid "IMPORTANT: There are TWO separate GPU support systems in q2m3:"
msgstr "重要：q2m3 有两套独立的 GPU 支持系统："

#: of q2m3.core.device_utils:8
msgid ""
"PennyLane Lightning GPU (cuQuantum/CUDA): - Used by standard QPE circuits (without @qjit) - "
"Detected by HAS_LIGHTNING_GPU flag - Requires: pennylane-lightning[gpu], cuQuantum, CUDA"
msgstr ""
"PennyLane Lightning GPU (cuQuantum/CUDA)：- 用于标准 QPE 电路（不使用 @qjit）；- 通过 HAS_LIGHTNING_GPU 标志检测；- "
"需要 pennylane-lightning[gpu]、cuQuantum 和 CUDA。"

#: of q2m3.core.device_utils:13
msgid ""
"JAX/Catalyst GPU (jaxlib[cuda]): - Used by Catalyst @qjit compiled circuits - Detected by "
"HAS_JAX_CUDA flag - Requires: jax[cuda11_pip] or jax[cuda12_pip]"
msgstr ""
"JAX/Catalyst GPU (jaxlib[cuda])：- 用于 Catalyst @qjit 编译电路；- 通过 HAS_JAX_CUDA 标志检测；- 需要 "
"jax[cuda11_pip] 或 jax[cuda12_pip]。"

#: of q2m3.core.device_utils:18
msgid ""
"When Catalyst @qjit is enabled, even with lightning.gpu device, the actual execution backend is "
"determined by JAX, NOT PennyLane. If JAX lacks CUDA support, Catalyst runs on CPU regardless of "
"device name."
msgstr ""
"启用 Catalyst @qjit 时，即使设备为 lightning.gpu，实际执行后端也由 JAX 决定，而非 PennyLane。若 JAX 不支持 "
"CUDA，无论设备名称为何，Catalyst 均在 CPU 上运行。"

#: of q2m3.core.device_utils.get_best_available_device:1
msgid "Return the name of the best available device."
msgstr "返回当前最佳可用设备的名称。"

#: of q2m3.core.device_utils.get_best_available_device:3
msgid "Priority: lightning.gpu > lightning.qubit > default.qubit"
msgstr "优先级：lightning.gpu > lightning.qubit > default.qubit"

#: of q2m3.core.device_utils.get_best_available_device:5
msgid "Device name string"
msgstr "设备名称字符串"

#: of q2m3.core.device_utils.get_catalyst_backend_info:1
msgid "Get detailed information about Catalyst execution backend."
msgstr "获取 Catalyst 执行后端的详细信息。"

#: of q2m3.core.device_utils.get_catalyst_backend_info:3
msgid ""
"IMPORTANT: Catalyst @qjit uses JAX as its execution backend, which is SEPARATE from PennyLane "
"device selection. Even if device=\"lightning.gpu\", Catalyst will run on CPU if JAX lacks CUDA "
"support."
msgstr ""
"重要：Catalyst @qjit 使用 JAX 作为执行后端，该后端独立于 PennyLane 设备选择。即使 device=\"lightning.gpu\"，若 JAX 不支持 "
"CUDA，Catalyst 仍在 CPU 上运行。"

#: of q2m3.core.device_utils.get_catalyst_backend_info:7
msgid ""
"- jax_backend: JAX default backend (\"cpu\", \"cuda\", \"gpu\") - has_jax_cuda: Whether JAX has "
"CUDA support - effective_device: Actual execution device for Catalyst - warning: Optional warning"
" message if GPU expected but unavailable"
msgstr ""
"- jax_backend: JAX 默认后端（\"cpu\"、\"cuda\"、\"gpu\"）- has_jax_cuda: JAX 是否支持 CUDA - "
"effective_device: Catalyst 的实际执行设备 - warning: 期望使用 GPU 但 GPU 不可用时的可选警告信息"

#: of q2m3.core.device_utils.get_catalyst_backend_info:7
msgid "jax_backend: JAX default backend (\"cpu\", \"cuda\", \"gpu\")"
msgstr "jax_backend: JAX 默认后端（\"cpu\"、\"cuda\"、\"gpu\"）"

#: of q2m3.core.device_utils.get_catalyst_backend_info:8
msgid "has_jax_cuda: Whether JAX has CUDA support"
msgstr "has_jax_cuda: JAX 是否支持 CUDA"

#: of q2m3.core.device_utils.get_catalyst_backend_info:9
msgid "effective_device: Actual execution device for Catalyst"
msgstr "effective_device: Catalyst 的实际执行设备"

#: of q2m3.core.device_utils.get_catalyst_backend_info:10
msgid "warning: Optional warning message if GPU expected but unavailable"
msgstr "warning: 期望使用 GPU 但 GPU 不可用时的可选警告信息"

#: of q2m3.core.device_utils.get_effective_catalyst_device_label:1
msgid "Get the effective device label for Catalyst execution."
msgstr "获取 Catalyst 执行的实际设备标签。"

#: of q2m3.core.device_utils.get_effective_catalyst_device_label:3
msgid ""
"Unlike get_best_available_device() which returns the PennyLane device name, this returns what "
"Catalyst actually runs on (CPU/GPU based on JAX backend)."
msgstr "get_best_available_device() 返回 PennyLane 设备名称；此函数返回 Catalyst 实际运行的设备（由 JAX 后端决定为 CPU 或 GPU）。"

#: of q2m3.core.device_utils.get_effective_catalyst_device_label:6
msgid "CPU)\" or \"lightning.gpu (JAX: GPU)\""
msgstr "CPU)\" 或 \"lightning.gpu (JAX: GPU)\""

#: of q2m3.core.device_utils.get_catalyst_effective_backend:1
msgid "Get human-readable Catalyst execution backend label."
msgstr "获取便于阅读的 Catalyst 执行后端标签。"

#: of q2m3.core.device_utils.get_catalyst_effective_backend:3
msgid "String like \"GPU (JAX CUDA)\" or \"CPU (JAX)\""
msgstr "类似 \"GPU (JAX CUDA)\" 或 \"CPU (JAX)\" 的字符串"

#: of q2m3.core.device_utils.select_device:1
msgid "Select quantum device based on device_type parameter."
msgstr "根据 device_type 参数选择量子设备。"

#: of q2m3.core.device_utils.select_device:3
msgid ""
"NOTE: As of PennyLane v0.43, setting shots on device is deprecated. Use qml.set_shots() transform"
" on QNode instead."
msgstr "注意：自 PennyLane v0.43 起，在设备上设置 shots 已弃用。改为对 QNode 使用 qml.set_shots() 变换。"

#: of q2m3.core.device_utils.select_device:6
msgid ""
"Device selection strategy: - \"auto\": Auto-select best available (GPU > lightning.qubit > "
"default.qubit) - \"default.qubit\": Standard PennyLane simulator - \"lightning.qubit\": High-"
"performance CPU simulator - \"lightning.gpu\": GPU-accelerated simulator (requires cuQuantum)"
msgstr ""
"设备选择策略：- \"auto\"：自动选择可用的最佳设备 (GPU > lightning.qubit > default.qubit)；- \"default.qubit\"：标准 "
"PennyLane 模拟器；- \"lightning.qubit\"：高性能 CPU 模拟器；- \"lightning.gpu\"：GPU 加速模拟器（需要 cuQuantum）。"

#: of q2m3.core.device_utils.select_device:11
msgid "Number of qubits"
msgstr "量子比特数"

#: of q2m3.core.device_utils.select_device:12
msgid "If True, ensure Catalyst-compatible fallback (lightning.qubit instead of default.qubit)"
msgstr "若为 True，确保回退设备兼容 Catalyst（使用 lightning.qubit，而非 default.qubit）"

#: of q2m3.core.device_utils.select_device:14
msgid "Optional device seed for reproducible shot-based sampling"
msgstr "可选的设备随机种子，用于可复现的有限次数测量采样"

#: of q2m3.core.device_utils.select_device:16
msgid "PennyLane device instance"
msgstr "PennyLane 设备实例"

#: ../../source/api-reference/core.rst:46
msgid "Hamiltonian Utilities"
msgstr "哈密顿量工具"

#: of q2m3.core.hamiltonian_utils:1
msgid "PennyLane Hamiltonian operator utilities."
msgstr "PennyLane 哈密顿量算符工具。"

#: of q2m3.core.hamiltonian_utils:3
msgid ""
"Provides helper functions for decomposing PennyLane Sum/Hamiltonian objects (PennyLane 0.44+ "
"compatible) and building operator index maps for efficient coefficient updates in QM/MM "
"simulations."
msgstr "提供辅助函数，用于分解 PennyLane Sum/Hamiltonian 对象（兼容 PennyLane 0.44+），以及构建算符索引映射，以高效更新 QM/MM 模拟中的系数。"

#: of q2m3.core.hamiltonian_utils.decompose_hamiltonian:1
msgid "Extract (coeffs, ops) from PennyLane Sum/Hamiltonian."
msgstr "从 PennyLane Sum/Hamiltonian 提取 (coeffs, ops)。"

#: of q2m3.core.hamiltonian_utils.decompose_hamiltonian:3
msgid ""
"PennyLane 0.44+ returns Sum of SProd from qml.qchem.molecular_hamiltonian. We need separate "
"coefficients and operators for qml.dot(coeffs, ops)."
msgstr ""
"PennyLane 0.44+ 的 qml.qchem.molecular_hamiltonian 返回由 SProd 组成的 Sum。qml.dot(coeffs, ops) "
"需要分离的系数与算符。"

#: of q2m3.core.hamiltonian_utils.decompose_hamiltonian:6
msgid "PennyLane Hamiltonian (Sum of SProd operators)"
msgstr "PennyLane 哈密顿量（SProd 算符之和）"

#: of q2m3.core.hamiltonian_utils.decompose_hamiltonian:8
msgid ""
"Tuple of (coefficients, operators) where coefficients are floats and operators are PennyLane "
"operator instances."
msgstr "(coefficients, operators) 元组，其中 coefficients 为浮点数，operators 为 PennyLane 算符实例。"

#: of q2m3.core.hamiltonian_utils.build_operator_index_map:1
msgid "Scan ops to find Identity and single-Z(wire) indices for MM coefficient updates."
msgstr "扫描 ops，查找 Identity 与单个 Z(wire) 的索引，用于 MM 系数更新。"

#: of q2m3.core.hamiltonian_utils.build_operator_index_map:3
msgid ""
"If any Z(wire) for wire in range(n_system_qubits) is missing, appends a coeff=0.0 placeholder to "
"ensure all spin orbitals can receive MM corrections."
msgstr "若 range(n_system_qubits) 中任一 wire 缺少 Z(wire)，则追加 coeff=0.0 的占位项，确保所有自旋轨道都能接收 MM 修正。"

#: of q2m3.core.hamiltonian_utils.build_operator_index_map:6
